            "type": "text",
            "value": "If you are flying with an economy ticket, there is a possibility that you may get upgraded to business class, especially if you hold a gold card in the airlines frequent flier program. If you dont hold a gold card, there is a possibility that you will get bumped off the flight if it is full and you check in late. This is shown in the figure hereafter. Note that each box (i.e. statement) has been numbered."
